WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.925 --> 00:00:11.637
Would any remaining
passengers for flight KA29,

00:00:11.637 --> 00:00:14.640
please make their
way to gate B15.

00:00:15.474 --> 00:00:18.393
Good morning, everyone, this is
Captain Robin Allen speaking.

00:00:18.644 --> 00:00:22.606
Flight time today
6 hours, 54 minutes.

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:34.201
Stay in your seats! 

00:00:34.201 --> 00:00:35.285
Get down now!

00:00:37.079 --> 00:00:38.914
Operation has commenced.

00:00:38.914 --> 00:00:40.165
Phones, tablets.

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:41.416
Plane is under control.

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:44.419
You need to see this.

00:00:44.836 --> 00:00:46.338
Plane veered off course.

00:00:47.214 --> 00:00:48.590
Someone is calling for help.

00:00:52.636 --> 00:00:54.179
You got family? Loved ones?

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:56.181
We’ve got one job
to do right now.

00:00:56.181 --> 00:00:57.808
Just get through it for them.

00:00:58.267 --> 00:01:00.143
I got a message from the plane. 

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:02.521
Dad says incident onboard. 

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:05.607
What exactly does
your dad do for a living?

00:01:05.607 --> 00:01:06.984
It’s difficult to explain. 

00:01:06.984 --> 00:01:08.527
Sam is the best at handling it. 

00:01:08.777 --> 00:01:09.486
Handling what?

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:11.446
The negotiation.

00:01:14.283 --> 00:01:16.076
There are 200 people
on this flight.

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:18.620
If they try something,

00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:20.622
and then this plane goes down.

00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:22.916
I don’t get home to my family.

00:01:24.251 --> 00:01:25.961
Let me make you an offer. 

00:01:27.546 --> 00:01:29.840
I’ve been handed demands. 

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:31.300
If it’s all going wrong
in the first hour,

00:01:31.967 --> 00:01:32.968
imagine the next 6.

00:01:33.844 --> 00:01:36.305
We need to get a message
to the whole plane.

00:01:37.014 --> 00:01:38.223
We just need to be ready. 

00:01:42.019 --> 00:01:43.645
There’s other stuff going down. 

00:01:43.645 --> 00:01:46.106
Five passengers on that
plane do not exist. 

00:01:46.732 --> 00:01:49.401
It's a network running
all across Europe.

00:01:50.235 --> 00:01:51.987
To them, we’re an
incoming missile. 

00:01:56.366 --> 00:01:58.327
It’s either us or them. 

00:01:59.202 --> 00:02:01.705
And I can tell you it’s
not going to be us. 

00:02:01.705 --> 00:02:07.044
♪♪

